0:30.650" end="00:30.950">heart </span><span begin="00:30.950" end="00:31.160">that's </span><span begin="00:31.160" end="00:31.280">on </span><span begin="00:31.280" end="00:31.370">my </span><span begin="00:31.370" end="00:32.180">sleeve</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.210" end="00:33.980"><span begin="00:32.210" end="00:32.540">I </span><span begin="00:32.540" end="00:32.930">got </span><span begin="00:32.930" end="00:33.290">what </span><span begin="00:33.290" end="00:33.620">you </span><span begin="00:33.620" end="00:33.980">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.040" end="00:35.360"><span begin="00:34.040" end="00:34.190">Oh </span><span begin="00:34.190" end="00:35.360">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.810" end="00:37.880"><span begin="00:35.810" end="00:36.200">I </span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.560">got </span><span begin="00:36.560" end="00:36.980">what </span><span begin="00:36.980" end="00:37.310">you </span><span begin="00:37.310" end="00:37.880">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.910" end="00:41.630"><span begin="00:37.910" end="00:38.360">See </span><span begin="00:38.360" end="00:38.480">it </span><span begin="00:38.480" end="00:38.570">in </span><span begin="00:38.570" end="00:38.870">your </span><span begin="00:38.870" end="00:39.200">eyes</span><span begin="00:39.200" end="00:39.200">, </span><span begin="00:39.200" end="00:39.260">you </span><span begin="00:39.260" end="00:39.500">just </span><span begin="00:39.500" end="00:39.800">tryna </span><span begin="00:39.800" end="00:40.310">get </span><span begin="00:40.310" end="00:41.630">on</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.690" end="00:43.700"><span begin="00:41.690" end="00:42.050">I </span><span begin="00:42.050" end="00:42.410">know </span><span begin="00:42.410" end="00:42.680">what </span><span begin="00:42.680" end="00:43.160">she </span><span begin="00:43.160" end="00:43.700">wants</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.730" end="00:46.280"><span begin="00:43.730" end="00:44.210">She </span><span begin="00:44.210" end="00:44.420">got </span><span begin="00:44.420" end="00:44.660">more </span><span begin="00:44.660" end="00:44.990">issues </span><span begin="00:44.990" end="00:45.200">than </span><span begin="00:45.200" end="00:45.260">a </span><span begin="00:45.260" end="00:46.280">magazine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.310" end="00:50.060"><span begin="00:46.310" end="00:46.400">I </span><span begin="00:46.400" end="00:46.700">had </span><span begin="00:46.700" end="00:46.760">a </span><span begin="00:46.760" end="00:47.150">girl </span><span begin="00:47.150" end="00:47.420">named </span><span begin="00:47.420" end="00:47.960">Mercedes</span><span begin="00:47.960" end="00:47.960">, </span><span begin="00:47.960" end="00:48.140">used </span><span begin="00:48.140" end="00:48.230">to </span><span begin="00:48.230" end="00:48.530">love </span><span begin="00:48.530" end="00:48.620">it </span><span begin="00:48.620" end="00:48.800">when </span><span begin="00:48.800" end="00:49.340">she </span><span begin="00:49.340" end="00:50.060">bends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.090" end="00:52.820"><span begin="00:50.090" end="00:50.240">When </span><span begin="00:50.240" end="00:50.450">she </span><span begin="00:50.450" end="00:50.690">make </span><span begin="00:50.690" end="00:50.810">me </span><span begin="00:50.810" end="00:51.110">mad</span><span begin="00:51.110" end="00:51.110">, </span><span begin="00:51.110" end="00:51.200">I </span><span begin="00:51.200" end="00:51.440">leave </span><span begin="00:51.440" end="00:51.620">her </span><span begin="00:51.620" end="00:51.860">ass </span><span begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.250">on </span><span begin="00:52.250" end="00:52.820">read</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.880" end="00:55.910"><span begin="00:52.880" end="00:52.970">I </span><span begin="00:52.970" end="00:53.360">never </span><span begin="00:53.360" end="00:53.600">let </span><span begin="00:53.600" end="00:53.780">these </span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:54.140">girls </span><span begin="00:54.140" end="00:54.530">get </span><span begin="00:54.530" end="00:54.710">to </span><span begin="00:54.710" end="00:55.190">my </span><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.910">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.970" end="01:00.110"><span begin="00:55.970" end="00:56.150">I'm </span><span begin="00:56.150" end="00:56.330">too </span><span begin="00:56.330" end="00:56.690">busy </span><span begin="00:56.690" end="00:57.140">countin' </span><span begin="00:57.140" end="00:57.350">all </span><span begin="00:57.350" end="00:57.470">of </span><span begin="00:57.470" end="00:58.100">this </span><span begin="00:58.100" end="00:58.850">bread </span><span begin="00:58.850" end="00:58.910">（</span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.060">oh</span><span begin="00:59.060" end="00:59.060">, </span><span begin="00:59.060" end="01:00.080">yeah</span><span begin="01:00.080" end="01:00.110">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.110" end="01:02.300"><span begin="01:00.110" end="01:00.350">What </span><span begin="01:00.350" end="01:00.560">can </span><span begin="01:00.560" end="01:00.680">they </span><span begin="01:00.680" end="01:01.010">say </span><span begin="01:01.010" end="01:01.280">to </span><span begin="01:01.280" end="01:02.270">me</span><span begin="01:02.270" end="01:02.300">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.300" end="01:05.990"><span begin="01:02.300" end="01:02.630">'Cause </span><span begin="01:02.630" end="01:02.810">if </span><span begin="01:02.810" end="01:02.930">I </span><span begin="01:02.930" end="01:03.320">left </span><span begin="01:03.320" end="01:03.500">then </span><span begin="01:03.500" end="01:03.650">they </span><span begin="01:03.650" end="01:03.980">wait </span><span begin="01:03.980" end="01:04.190">for </span><span begin="01:04.190" end="01:04.760">me </span><span begin="01:04.760" end="01